---
---
<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="badge">Système d'acquisition local · Exclusif à votre territoire</div>
    <h1>Votre ville a une seule place disponible.</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Écosystème Immo installe votre système d'acquisition local — site professionnel,
      SEO, Google Business, pages quartiers, CRM et automatisations IA.
      <strong>Un seul conseiller par ville.</strong>
    </p>
    <div class="cta-group">
      <a href="#verifier" class="btn-primary">Vérifier si ma ville est disponible</a>
      <a href="#process" class="btn-secondary">Comment ça marche</a>
    </div>
    <p class="trust-line">Sans engagement · Réponse sous 24h · Un seul conseiller par ville</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    background: #f8fafc;
    padding: 88px 16px 96px;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #e2e8f0;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 5px 14px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 6.5vw, 58px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: #0f172a;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2.2vw, 19px);
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    max-width: 580px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .subtitle strong {
    color: #0f172a;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cta-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #0f172a;
    color: #f8fafc;
    padding: 15px 26px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: transparent;
    color: #0f172a;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: #0f172a; }

  .trust-line {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero { padding: 64px 16px 72px; }
    .btn-primary,
    .btn-secondary {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .cta-group { flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
